        "title": "FALSE OR MISLEADING DISPUTE CLAIMS",
        "body": "False, fabricated or misleading chargeback or dispute claims are prohibited.\r\n\r\nWhere an investigation establishes misuse of the dispute mechanism, Mera Digital Pay may take appropriate action, including:\r\n\r\n- Rejecting the claim;\r\n- Recovering applicable losses;\r\n- Adjusting or withholding applicable amounts;\r\n- Restricting relevant services;\r\n- Suspending the Partner account;\r\n- Terminating the relevant service relationship where permitted;\r\n- Reporting the matter to the relevant institution or authority; and/or\r\n- Taking legal action where appropriate.\r\n\r\n---"
